## 7. Reporting

We will issue a draft report by {{ engagement.draft_report_target or engagement.report_due or "the date agreed" }} and a final report by {{ engagement.final_report_target or engagement.report_due or "the date agreed" }}. Draft findings are not shared until they have passed Futran quality review. You will have the opportunity to respond to each finding before the report is final.

## 8. Confidentiality and data

Futran treats everything you share as confidential. Evidence is stored in the Futran Audit Platform, separated from every other client, and kept for {{ engagement.retention_years or 7 }} years after the engagement is completed unless we agree otherwise. Employee attestation responses are seen only by your Chief AI Compliance Officer, your Data Protection Officer and the assigned Futran auditors; department leads see totals only.

## 9. Limitations

An audit gives reasonable, not absolute, assurance. Our findings rely on the information and evidence you provide. This assessment is not legal advice; confirm the legal position on any finding with your counsel.

